00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,320
我的牙是不疼了……
It did stop hurting.

187
00:09:38,460 --> 00:09:39,380
你就别帮腔了。
Don't you start.

188
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:42,780
而且保险单粘在抽屉底下也被我找到了。
And I did find the insurance form stuck to the bottom of the drawer.

189
00:09:43,280 --> 00:09:46,560
Maggie，保险单一向都粘在抽屉底，
Maggie,insurance forms are always stuck to the bottoms of drawers.

190
00:09:46,860 --> 00:09:47,260
难道你忘了？
Where have you been?

191
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:51,340
爸爸，你不相信魔力，怎么解释世上的奇迹？
Dad,without magic,how do you explain the miracle of life,

192
00:09:51,540 --> 00:09:53,960
宇宙的奥秘又怎么来解释？
the mystery and the wonder of the universe,

193
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:56,080
还有儿童的想象力？
the imagination of a child...?

194
00:09:56,660 --> 00:09:59,060
还有牛顿的全部事业。
Wayne Noon's entire career!

195
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:01,820
你真的以为你这样说你就捡了个便宜货吗？
Must you take cheap shots at the man who brought us "danker shein"?

196
00:10:04,380 --> 00:10:08,120
电视里的那些人不是只要寄钱就能帮你治病吗？
What about all those guys on TV who cure you if you send them money?

197
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:09,800
我钦佩这些人。
My heroes.

198
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,380
不过我认为Ben，
Look,the point is Ben,

199
00:10:12,380 --> 00:10:14,700
如果世界上真有魔石的话
if there were any such thing as "magic rocks"

200
00:10:15,330 --> 00:10:17,680
那可只能出现在加利福尼亚。
then the only place you could find them would be California.

201
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:20,940
事实上恐怕有不少人在寻找它们。
In fact,I'm sure the people out there are just tripping over them.

202
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:25,400
Ben，说不定你的魔石还能帮我们洗衣服。
Well Ben,maybe your magic rock can finish the laundry for me.

203
00:10:26,020 --> 00:10:26,460
亲爱的！
Honey.

204
00:10:26,460 --> 00:10:27,900
一位母亲的幻想。
A mother can dream.

205
00:10:30,030 --> 00:10:31,470
我要去看书了。
Ah,I gotta hit the books!

206
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:36,680
Mike？你一看到书就会觉得胆战心惊。
Mike,books are those square paper things that frighten you.

207
00:10:39,140 --> 00:10:40,280
说到书，Mike？
Speaking of books Mike...

208
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:41,980
哦，爸爸，我知道今晚要看书，
Ah Dad,I know it's a school night

209
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,100
但我得去和波拿确认我演讲稿的研究论点。
but I have to go to Boner's to check some research for my speech,ok?

210
00:10:44,660 --> 00:10:45,200
去吧，Mike。
Sure Mike.

211
00:10:45,260 --> 00:10:47,560
可爸爸，我……去吧？
But Dad I...sure?

212
00:10:49,540 --> 00:10:52,510
但必须把你的房间整理好。
Yeah you can go just as soon as you clean up your room.

213
00:10:52,510 --> 00:10:55,520
爸爸，我的房间属于我的天地。
D..Dad,I thought my room was my space.

214
00:10:55,520 --> 00:10:56,680
那天地发臭了！
Your space smells.

215
