Mike! You call that clean?

217
00:11:21,540 --> 00:11:22,980
他怎么全知道！
How does he do that?

218
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:26,840
HI，Mike，给一美元我给你收拾。
Hey Mike! Clean your room for a Buck.

219
00:11:28,250 --> 00:11:32,010
是你的了。谢谢你Ben。
Alright,you're on. Thanks Benny.

220
00:11:32,900 --> 00:11:37,400
魔石，请你收拾Mike的房间，魔石，
Magic rock,clean Mike's room. Magic rock....

221
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:38,260
不，Ben，
No no no no no,Ben,

222
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:39,880
请你真的动手好吗？
you're gonna clean my room for real,ok?

223
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:43,380
它已经干净了。不信你看吧。
It's already clean. See for yourself.

224
00:11:44,580 --> 00:11:48,060
还是把钱还给我吧。Ben，
Give me my Dollar. Ben,

225
00:11:48,060 --> 00:11:49,120
你不能……
you can't...

226
00:11:59,810 --> 00:12:02,990
Ben，Ben，我们谈谈！
Hey Ben,we gotta talk!

227
00:12:20,580 --> 00:12:21,260
你别碰，
You can't have it!

228
00:12:21,360 --> 00:12:22,600
不能给你，这是我的。
You can't touch it,it's mine.

229
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:23,900
给我吧，小Ben。
Ah,come on Benny!

230
00:12:24,700 --> 00:12:27,560
我对你说过，我讨厌别人叫我小Ben！
Have I ever told you how much I hate being called Benny?

231
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:30,860
你说过多次，但我刚理解你的意思。
Yes,many times,and I'm just now getting the message.

232
00:12:31,030 --> 00:12:31,940
很好。
Good.

233
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:33,240
你急着要去哪？
Look Ben,what's your hurry?

234
00:12:33,820 --> 00:12:34,980
我得快走，
I gotta go.

235
00:12:35,100 --> 00:12:36,820
我还有许多奇迹要表演呢。
I have many miracles to perform.

236
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,110
我想和你商量……
Ok,one quick thought here...

237
00:12:38,110 --> 00:12:38,990
别过来。
Back!!

238
00:12:38,990 --> 00:12:41,110
