你这精神病医生可真会糊弄人。
Boy you psychiatrists sure know how to run a scam!

242
00:13:02,420 --> 00:13:03,140
谢谢。
Thank you.

243
00:13:03,420 --> 00:13:06,100
挺容易上钩的。鼻子让我们牵着了。
What an easy mark,he was ripe for the plucking!

244
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:10,600
Carol，咱们的目的是要让Mike尝尝受骗的滋味，
Carol,our purpose here is to teach Mike how it feels to be conned

245
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:12,900
把他骗你和Ben的那十块钱拿回来。
and to get back the ten Bucks that he took from you and Ben.

246
00:13:13,280 --> 00:13:14,440
你说得很对。
You're right of course.

247
00:13:16,040 --> 00:13:17,240
蠢货一个。
What a sucker!!

248
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:18,220
傻瓜一个。
Oh what a pigeon!!

249
00:13:18,440 --> 00:13:19,680
真是太有意思了。
I love this!

250
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:22,410
要知道，咱们可以出售这种魔石，
Yes,well you know,we could sell those magic rocks

251
00:13:22,410 --> 00:13:23,610
发它一大笔财。
and we could make a fortune.

252
00:13:23,800 --> 00:13:26,260
你从报馆辞职，我也不干这活了，
Yeah,you could give up the paper,I could give up my practice,

253
00:13:26,700 --> 00:13:29,780
我们可以全国转悠骗人钱财
we could all go from town to town fleecing and bilking people.

254
00:13:30,460 --> 00:13:31,760
最后被捕，
Yeah then we could get arrested

255
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:35,180
然后我们就把我们的故事卖给好莱坞去拍电视剧：
and we could sell our story to Hollywood,TV movie of the week,

256
00:13:35,180 --> 00:13:37,500
Seaver一家罪恶的生涯。
"The Seavers- A Life Of Crime".

257
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:41,920
让法朗·福斯特来扮演你，当然让张伯伦来扮演我。
Farah Fosset could play you,I'd be played by Richard Chamberlain of course.

258
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,620
电视剧第一集……
And in part one maybe...

259
00:13:43,620 --> 00:13:44,400
Jason.

260
00:13:44,400 --> 00:13:44,500
Jason，

261
00:13:44,500 --> 00:13:44,600
干吗
Yes.

262
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:47,700
你故意这样说给我听。
You have a certain quality that gets on my nerves.

263
00:13:48,820 --> 00:13:51,400
我只是认为你们对这玩意太热衷了。
I just think you guys are enjoying this a little too much.

264
00:13:52,180 --> 00:13:53,980
摩玲·历瓦德他愿意拍吗？
Does Molly Ringwall do TV?

265
