你就别说了。
Now stop it.

266
00:13:56,680 --> 00:13:59,380
我只是想让Mike现在要得到他的教训
'Cause I'm sure right about now Mike is learning his lesson.

267
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:03,440
对，他就象一条小狗，到处跟着Ben。
Yeah...following Ben around like a little puppy.

268
00:14:04,510 --> 00:14:08,950
哈哈哈。张伯伦演你
Ha ha ha Richard Chamberlain!!

269
