你究竟愿意出多少钱？
Now how much were you offering again?

270
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:16,580
35，35美元，小Ben。
Thirty...five. Thirty five Dollars Benny!

271
00:14:17,100 --> 00:14:18,180
你叫我什么？
What was that?

272
00:14:18,280 --> 00:14:19,890
小飞侠Ben
Benjamin.

273
