谢谢。50！
Better. Fifty.

274
00:14:22,380 --> 00:14:23,720
可我没有五十美元。
Ben,I don't have fifty!

275
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:24,860
你有的。
Yes you do!

276
00:14:25,060 --> 00:14:27,080
你生日时外公外婆给你的钱，
Your birthday money from Grandma and Grandpa,

277
00:14:27,160 --> 00:14:32,080
藏在你衣柜的第二个抽屉的旅游杂志下面。
it's in your second dresser drawer under your National Geographics!

278
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:34,170
好吧，好吧，我去拿。
Ok. Ok. Alright.

279
00:14:34,170 --> 00:14:37,220
那样我就会有点钱了。
Hhmmm. So I'd have the money but

280
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:40,160
可每天的垃圾还得我倒。
I'd still have to take the garbage out every night...

281
00:14:40,450 --> 00:14:42,830
好吧，我来倒一个月垃圾。
Alright,I'll do the garbage for a month.

282
00:14:43,660 --> 00:14:45,080
每天还要擦桌子。
And clear the table every night?

283
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:47,020
你这小子也太……
Why you little...

284
00:14:47,020 --> 00:14:48,960
太可爱了。
terrific kid.

285
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:53,260
还不能让爸爸妈妈知道你付给我多少钱！
Of course Mom and Dad could never know how much you paid me.

286
00:14:53,330 --> 00:14:55,450
那我就说是你送给我的。
No no no,I'll tell 'em that you gave it too me.

287
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:58,440
不，就说花十美元买的。
No. Tell 'em you paid me ten Bucks.

288
00:14:58,560 --> 00:14:59,460
不多也不少。
No more no less.

289
00:14:59,640 --> 00:15:00,500
随你的便吧，
Yeah fine whatever!

290
00:15:00,500 --> 00:15:03,100
因为我明天的演讲课正需要魔石，
I just need some kind of magic for my speech class tomorrow.

291
00:15:03,100 --> 00:15:04,440
成交了吧。
So it's a deal,right?

292
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:06,480
我还得考虑一下。
I'll sleep on it.

293
00:15:08,340 --> 00:15:11,510
我的第一个魔法要把他变成蛇……
Well the first thing I'm gonna do is turn him into a snake...

294
00:15:12,590 --> 00:15:14,610
不行，太迟了。
na I'm too late.

295
00:15:18,980 --> 00:15:20,880
然后医生就洗手了，
Then the Doctor washes his hands,

296
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:23,420
房间用水冲洗，就这些。
they hose down the room,and that's it.

297
00:15:23,540 --> 00:15:26,460
我关于婴儿出生的演讲到此结束。
Thisconcludes my speech on where babies come from.

298
00:15:32,010 --> 00:15:33,650
有问题吗？
Well any questions?

299
00:15:33,650 --> 00:15:38,270
不不，慢着，慢着。你讲得也太
No! No,that was extremely...

300
00:15:38,270 --> 00:15:39,500
具体了。
thorough.

301
00:15:39,500 --> 00:15:40,210
哦谢谢！
Oh,thanks.

302
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:42,460
不过我在想，如果想让
However,I can't help but wonder if it...if it really

303
00:15:42,460 --> 00:15:43,780
演讲效果更好一点
wouldn't have been more effective

304
00:15:43,780 --> 00:15:47,200
你可以用专用名称来称谓
if you had used the proper names for the..er..you know...

305
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:48,940
身体的某部分
parts of the body.

306
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:52,100
我就是这样做的啊。
Err,I did.

307
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:56,360
是吗？下去吧。波拿同学，
Yeah? You may sit. Er Mr. Stabone,

308
00:15:56,530 --> 00:15:59,490
请你把你的实物模型也带下去。……
please would you...could...would you take your visual aids with you.

309
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:12,840
大家先休息一会，定定神。
Ohh,let's just take a moment here. Ok? And catch our breath.

310
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:15,800
演讲好极了，波拿。
Great speech Bones!

311
00:16:15,860 --> 00:16:18,440
谢谢你，我三分之一的成绩就该靠它了。
Thanks a lot man,I knew a third of my grade depended on it.

312
00:16:22,710 --> 00:16:27,960
好了，下一位该谁了？Mike Seaver。
Alright,well now let's see who's next...Mike Seaver!

313
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:29,850
看看这魔力吧！
Watch this Bone.

314
00:16:41,340 --> 00:16:48,420
伟大的演讲！伟大的演讲！伟大的演讲！
Oh. Great speech great speech great speech great speech.

315
00:16:48,420 --> 00:16:48,520
你的题目是什么？
What's your topic?

316
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:48,620
魔力。
Ah...magic!

317
00:16:48,620 --> 00:16:48,720
魔力？我的上帝啊。
Magic! Thank goodness.

318
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:48,780
伟大的演讲！伟大的演讲！
Great speech great speech great speech...

319
00:16:48,780 --> 00:16:49,800
你还没说呢？
Not yet it isn't.

320
00:16:51,680 --> 00:17:00,260
魔力，石头，呃，魔力
Magic! Rock! Ah! Magic! Johnson!

321
00:17:01,820 --> 00:17:04,620
Mike，我听不懂你在说什么。
Mike,I'm having a little trouble following this.

322
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:06,930
魔力。
Magic!

323
00:17:09,340 --> 00:17:12,740
Mike，也许你的临产期也太长了点。
Mike,I think you've over done the pregnant pause.

324
00:17:14,060 --> 00:17:15,740
你别发表意见，波拿同学。
Not a word Mr. Stabone!

325
00:17:18,340 --> 00:17:20,460
不能失败，我不能失败。
Look,I can't fail,I can't fail!

326
00:17:20,460 --> 00:17:21,590
你讲不讲？
You wanna bet?

327
00:17:22,020 --> 00:17:24,600
Mike，你不演讲就回到你的座位上去！
Mike,either finish your speech or take a seat.

328
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:26,520
你究竟肯不肯帮我的忙？！
Look,are you gonna help me out here,or what?

329
00:17:31,520 --> 00:17:32,520
我受骗了。
I've been conned!

330
00:17:32,660 --> 00:17:34,640
好了，够了。
Ok,that's it.

331
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:38,090
对了，题目是骗人的勾当。
Right! That's it,con jobs!

332
00:17:38,090 --> 00:17:39,320
你说什么？
I beg your pardon?

333
00:17:39,780 --> 00:17:41,920
这就是演讲的真正题目
Yeah now that's the real title of my speech.

334
00:17:42,020 --> 00:17:42,940
你们一定会非常欣赏的。
You're gonna love this Mrs. Skovanjario! Ok.

335
00:17:44,880 --> 00:17:46,540
骗人的勾当，朋友还是敌人
Con jobs! Friend or foe?

336
00:17:46,610 --> 00:17:48,050
每个人都可能上当，
You know anybody can be a victim.

337
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:49,440
你们信吗？
You don't believe me?

338
00:17:49,980 --> 00:17:52,680
在座的各位都很聪明可我刚才已经使你们认为
You all look pretty intelligent,but I just made you believe that

339
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,160
我非常无能。哈，
I didn't know what I was doing up here!

340
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:56,720
你们全上当了。
So foolish!

341
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:02,680
妈妈。
Hi Mom!

342
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:03,620
宝贝。
Hi Honey.

343
