Ben，你拿着什么？
Hey Ben,what you got there?

344
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:06,420
是一只棒球手套。
It's a catcher's mitt.

345
00:18:06,540 --> 00:18:08,880
上面有巴马的签名。
A Buzzie Babone autographed model!

346
00:18:09,080 --> 00:18:11,020
