and Carol's money back from Mike.

354
00:18:22,540 --> 00:18:23,040
我要了。
I did.

355
00:18:23,420 --> 00:18:24,750
是十美元？
Ten Dollars?

356
00:18:24,750 --> 00:18:25,650
对。
Yeah!

357
00:18:25,650 --> 00:18:26,620
总共？
Total?

358
00:18:26,620 --> 00:18:27,620
不是。
No.

359
00:18:28,420 --> 00:18:29,180
Ben，是多少？
Ben,how much?

360
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:30,910
五十美元。
Fifty Bucks,

361
00:18:31,020 --> 00:18:32,680
我想他该吸取教训了。
and I think he's learnt his lesson.

362
00:18:34,120 --> 00:18:35,700
Ben,Ben!

363
00:18:35,700 --> 00:18:35,740
Ben，Ben……

364
00:18:35,740 --> 00:18:36,760
你给我站住，
Hold it!

365
00:18:37,280 --> 00:18:38,780
你诈骗你哥哥了？！
You swindled your brother?

366
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:39,980
是咱们一伙。
We all did.

367
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:44,780
这是分成妈妈。爸爸，
Here's your cut Mom...Dad...

368
00:18:47,100 --> 00:18:47,820
你的，Carol。
there you go Carol.

369
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:49,700
这是什么？
What's this?

370
00:18:50,040 --> 00:18:51,900
Ben，我们只想给Mike一个教训，
Ben,we were trying to teach Mike a lesson,

371
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:52,800
不是向他骗五十美元。
not con him out of fifty Dollars.

372
00:18:53,830 --> 00:18:56,600
五十美元？！呵呵，
Fifty Bucks. Ha ha,

373
00:18:56,600 --> 00:18:57,360
真有你的！
what a chump!

374
00:19:00,260 --> 00:19:03,460
哦，Jason，你的这个愚蠢的计划产生负作用了。
Jason,this idiotic scheme of yours has got way out of hand.

375
00:19:03,510 --> 00:19:07,920
我只不过是想给他一个简单的精神上的教训。
Oh oh,well I was just trying to teach him a simple moral lesson.

376
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:09,640
没想到怎么会这样。
I don't know what went wrong.

377
00:19:12,100 --> 00:19:13,500
波拿？请进。
Boner! Come in!

378
00:19:14,760 --> 00:19:16,480
Mike呢？别把他藏起来！
Where's Mike? Don't try to hide him.

379
00:19:16,600 --> 00:19:17,440
到底出什么事了？
What's your problem?

380
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:19,760
他完全利用了我的单纯！
He took advantage of my innocence.

381
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:20,580
你说什么？
Pardon me?

382
00:19:20,670 --> 00:19:22,660
他把我的钱骗去了，
Mrs. Seaver,he like ripped me off.

383
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:25,240
把这块破石头卖给我，还说有魔力。
He sold me this stupid rock and told me it was magic.

384
00:19:25,320 --> 00:19:26,020
不。
No!!

385
00:19:26,020 --> 00:19:27,940
害得我滑板时冒险转弯
Yeah! I almost got killed trying to

386
00:19:27,940 --> 00:19:29,440
差点把命送了。
take Dead Man's Curve on my skateboard.

387
00:19:29,530 --> 00:19:31,040
这是真的？！
You didn't!

388
00:19:31,060 --> 00:19:33,360
当然真的。我以为有人石头
I did! I figured,with this rock,

389
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:37,060
就可以去闯没人闯过的禁区了。
I could boldly go,where no man has gone before.

390
00:19:40,580 --> 00:19:42,690
波拿，这根本不是什么魔石！
Boner,it's not a magic rock.

391
00:19:42,690 --> 00:19:46,290
别开玩笑，我整整花了六十美元。
No kidding. I'm out of sixty Bucks too.

392
00:19:46,900 --> 00:19:48,360
它升值了！
It's gone up!

393
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:51,110
Mike一回来就找他谈。
Look,we'll talk to Mike as soon as he gets home.

394
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:52,340
我也会。
So will I!

395
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:53,900
Jason，把波拿的钱还给他。
Jason let's get Boner his money back.

396
00:19:54,410 --> 00:19:56,200
好吧，我们大家把钱凑起来吧。
Ok then,let's everybody give me their money back.

397
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:57,320
拿来
Come on give me that!

398
00:19:57,680 --> 00:20:01,660
好，这是……
Right this is er...

399
00:20:01,740 --> 00:20:04,200
Ben，你就连分成也要占我们的便宜？
Ben you've even cheated us on the split!

400
00:20:05,500 --> 00:20:07,260
大部分工作都是我做的！
Hey,I did most of the work!

401
00:20:07,900 --> 00:20:10,180
你原来还两头骗！
Why you little double crosser!

402
00:20:10,260 --> 00:20:11,920
这算是迈阿密的罪恶。
What is this,Miami Vice?

403
00:20:15,730 --> 00:20:17,620
好了，一共是五十美元，
Ok,this is...fifty Dollars

404
00:20:17,620 --> 00:20:19,680
再加上一只巴马亲笔签名的手套。
and a genuine autographed Buzzie Babone mitt.

405
00:20:20,660 --> 00:20:22,020
哗。
Hey!!!

406
00:20:22,020 --> 00:20:24,800
是我最喜欢的运动员！
Cool it's my favourite baseball player!

407
00:20:24,800 --> 00:20:27,380
谢谢。你们真是好人！
Oh thanks,you guys are ok.

408
00:20:27,380 --> 00:20:31,460
这样吧，对Mike说我不想找他谈什么了。
Oh and tell Mike that I'm never speaking to him again.

409
00:20:31,460 --> 00:20:34,420
还是明天我自己对他说吧。
Oh never mind I'll tell him when I see him tomorrow.

410
00:20:46,280 --> 00:20:48,070
怎么样？
Well?

411
00:20:49,100 --> 00:20:50,840
你看我多能干！
I am good!

412
00:20:51,250 --> 00:20:52,320
哦，好极了！
Yes!

413
00:20:52,320 --> 00:20:54,620
退了五十块，外加垒球手套一只。
Fifty Bucks and a new catcher's mitt.

414
00:20:54,620 --> 00:20:56,580
手套你留着，算给你的奖品。
Alright! You can keep the mitt Bone,you earned it.

415
00:20:56,580 --> 00:20:59,410
石头给我好不好？
Err,could I have the rock too?

416
00:21:00,740 --> 00:21:01,500
干嘛？
What for?

417
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:04,050
我不知道，我想做纪念。
Oh I don't know...sentimental.

418
00:21:04,620 --> 00:21:05,320
好，接着。
Yeah here.

419
00:21:05,590 --> 00:21:06,630
Hey!!!

420
00:21:06,630 --> 00:21:08,300
你别激动，它毫无用处。
Hey relax it's worthless.

421
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:10,600
是这样吗？
You think so huh?

422
00:21:12,120 --> 00:21:13,040
什么？
What?

423
00:21:13,260 --> 00:21:14,820
我拿这块石头去上化学课，
I had this rock in my Chemistry class.

424
00:21:14,920 --> 00:21:16,620
林柏老师要我卖给它。
Mr. Rembelov offered to buy it from me.

425
00:21:16,760 --> 00:21:18,190
什么？
What?

426
00:21:18,190 --> 00:21:19,550
对。他是收藏家，
Yeah,it's a collectors.

427
00:21:19,550 --> 00:21:21,100
他说这块象是电气石，
This is called "Termaline" or something like that.

428
00:21:21,240 --> 00:21:22,060
非常少见。
Very rare.

429
00:21:22,520 --> 00:21:25,090
而且他说愿意出两百美元。
He's gonna give me two hundred bucks for it!

430
00:21:25,090 --> 00:21:27,050
波拿你太过分了！
Bone,this isn't fair.

431
00:21:27,240 --> 00:21:28,900
你说，这多有劲！
I know,aint it great?

432
00:21:34,380 --> 00:21:35,480
哦，你听我说，
Oh well fine!

433
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:36,860
可你想过没有？
But did it ever occur to you that

434
00:21:36,930 --> 00:21:40,180
骗人的人最终自己也会倒霉。
when you con you somebody you always get hurt!

435
00:21:41,940 --> 00:21:43,550
有人就是不接受教训。
Ah,some people never learn.

436
00:21:53,750 --> 00:21:55,920
该上床睡觉了，孩子们。
Alright,that's lights out you guys!

437
00:21:55,920 --> 00:21:59,050
Ben，Mike，得到了一个非常重要的教训。
Well I think that Mike and Ben have finally learnt their lesson.

438
00:21:59,050 --> 00:22:00,560
但愿他们能这样。
Well I hope so.

439
00:22:00,560 --> 00:22:02,770
对。他们知道说谎和
Yeah,well they've learnt that you can't lie to people,

440
00:22:02,770 --> 00:22:04,210
滥用别人信任的人
you can't abuse their trust,

441
00:22:04,210 --> 00:22:05,570
永远逃脱不了应受的惩罚。
you're not gonna get away with it.

442
00:22:05,570 --> 00:22:07,620
行骗的人绝没有好下场。
People get what's coming to them in this world.

443
00:22:07,620 --> 00:22:09,440
现在继续报导新闻，
Coming up on the news,

444
00:22:09,440 --> 00:22:12,160
前总统尼克松今晚应邀出席
former President Richard Nixon is honored tonight

445
00:22:12,160 --> 00:22:14,380
每个菜价值一千元的豪华筵席。
at a,thousand Dollar a plate,dinner.
